      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRUBBER KICK (8) has a terrific record this track and trip with three wins and three placings from six starts. Hit the frame latest (19.86) when second at Q Lakeside in a Grade 5. Looks a leading chance on best. GYPSY MOSS (4) goes very well this trip starting five times for two wins and two minors. Recorded a 1.5 lengths win (19.39) in a Grade 6 last time at this track. Looks suited here and can measure up. RAPTOR GIRL (1) sailed across from an outside draw last start to score an all-the-way win (21.89) at Q Lakeside in a Grade 5 over 390m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. One of main contenders. BONNIE ROYALE (2) is not to be discarded.",
